# Backend Conventions

## Package Management
- Always use `uv add <package>` — never `pip install`

## Configuration
- Use `pydantic-settings` for all config — never access `os.environ` directly
- Environment variables loaded from `backend/.env` via `app/config.py`

## Project Structure
- Routers → `app/routers/`
- Business logic → `app/services/`
- Pydantic models → `app/models/`

## API Design
- All endpoints must return Pydantic models — never return raw `dict`
- Use `async`/`await` throughout; no synchronous route handlers

## Garmin Service
- Handle token refresh gracefully — catch `GarminConnectAuthenticationError` and re-authenticate
- Never expose raw Garmin credentials or tokens in responses
